/**************************************************************************
Project: Predictors of Environmental Concern Among Oregon Residents
Author: Duke Ogeto Jesai
Software: Stata
Dataset: ops2004.dta

Description:
This project examines factors associated with environmental concern
among Oregon residents using multiple regression analysis.

**************************************************************************/

* Set up the data on stata
use ops2004.dta, clear

* Multiple regression analysis

regress env_con educat inc com3 hlthprob epht3, beta

* Run the pcorr command to estimate the increment in R2.
pcorr env_con educat inc com3 hlthprob epht3

